@baseUrl = http://localhost:41310
@acceptedOrder = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@expiredOrder = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
@transientId = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
@invalidId = 44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444

### Submit an order and publish OrderPlaced through the outbox
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "{{acceptedOrder}}", "confirmInvoice": true }

### Read the order, which becomes Accepted after invoice confirmation
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{acceptedOrder}}

### Request the invoice status from Billing
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{acceptedOrder}}/invoice

### Observe immediate retry followed by delayed redelivery
POST {{baseUrl}}/failures/transient/{{transientId}}

### Send a validation failure directly to the error queue
POST {{baseUrl}}/failures/validation/{{invalidId}}

### Submit an order without confirmation, then wait 30 seconds
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": "{{expiredOrder}}", "confirmInvoice": false }

### Read the expired order
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{expiredOrder}}

### Schedule a reminder and observe it after 10 seconds
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{acceptedOrder}}/reminder
